==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~20 seconds<sup>20f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s (500%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ginger Snache]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Mesocosmocyclone]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Bore]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively straightforward. Stall until your money is max at the beginning, then just spam [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and any other high damage dealers you might have for an easy victory.

